閱《庭刊》</a></p>\n</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://qr.payme.hsbc.com.hk/2/QrndvPxDgEi2MhNiNPz4b8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"916\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9CHKCourtNews_PayMe_QR_code.png\" width=\"716\"/></a></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/hkcourtnews_Octopus_QRcode_Payment_v4.png\" width=\"1080\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<p><strong>如欲接收每日報道整合，請在訊息欄內填寫電郵地址</strong></p>\n<p></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T10:21:18.306440+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2403,"images":3,"source":"法庭線","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T10:15:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T12:38:20.094711+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T10:18:20.666631+00:00","content_hash":"9b2bf2683a5294d8d19775c2401dc6ebf7f5c0db28196ff3c4822c98d06eba2b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 520","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}